# BuildKit reads this file, not the repository's root .dockerignore, when building
# dashboard/Dockerfile (the build context is the repository root).
**
!LICENSE
!dashboard/
!dashboard/**
**/node_modules
dashboard/dist
dashboard/coverage
# The e2e suite (Playwright) runs against the source tree, never inside the image build.
dashboard/e2e
dashboard/playwright*.ts
dashboard/.e2e-dist
dashboard/test-results
dashboard/playwright-report
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.log
**/*.key
**/*.pem
